{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "This outfit brings together your camel pencil skirt and chocolate shirt in a rich, autumnal palette that feels both classic and ready for the evening. The black pumps ground the look with polish, while the matching brooch adds a touch of elegant detail to your collar or lapel. Your golden earrings catch the light perfectly against your skin, creating a warm, glowing finish. Even though you'll be standing in a crowd at the rock concert, this ensemble keeps you looking put-together without feeling stiff; the tailored fit of the skirt flows naturally with movement, and the shirt offers enough structure to handle a busy night out.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the chocolate shirt neatly into the pencil skirt to emphasize your waist and keep the silhouette clean as you move through the crowd.",
    "Let the bag hang freely at your hip or across your body so it stays accessible for your phone and ticket stubs during the concert.",
    "Wear the headband slightly back from your forehead to keep hair off your face while maintaining a classic, effortless vibe."
  ],
