  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#144·00",
      "text": "This camel pencil skirt is a sleek, knee-length cut that follows the line of your legs with a smooth, structured fit. The fabric drapes cleanly to highlight your waist and create a polished vertical line from hip to ankle."
    },
    {
      "n": "#92·17",
      "text": "A small black brooch sits elegantly on the neckline or lapel of your shirt, offering a subtle contrast that adds just enough sparkle without overpowering the classic silhouette."
    },
    {
      "n": "#212·35",
      "text": "These golden earrings feature a warm metallic shine that complements your skin tone beautifully. Their refined shape provides a perfect balance to the structured lines of the skirt and shirt while catching the concert lights."
    },
    {
      "n": "#68·15",
      "text": "This headband is currently shown in a colour that clashes with your outfit, but we are swapping it for one that fits perfectly. The replacement will be a black or neutral-toned band that keeps your hair securely in place while maintaining the classic aesthetic you want."
    },
    {
      "n": "#62·35",
      "text": "These black pumps have a sleek, closed toe and a modest heel that offer comfort for standing all night while keeping your posture upright and confident. Their dark finish grounds the lighter camel tones in the outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#80·34",
      "text": "The chocolate shirt is tailored with a regular fit that sits comfortably at the waist, its rich brown hue creating a warm contrast against the camel skirt. The fabric appears smooth and structured enough to hold its shape through a long evening."
    },
    {
      "n": "#84·35",
      "text": "This camel bag matches the skirt perfectly, offering ample space for your essentials while staying light enough for all-night wear. Its soft, neutral tone ties the entire look together seamlessly."
    }
  ]
}

